{
	"name": "Swelled Rules",
	"short_name": "Swelled Rules",
	"description": "Columns of swelled rules, the printer's ornamental lines that are thick in the middle and fine at the ends, bent into S-curves that rise, fall or cross so the rules weave into feathers, stripes and lattices. Click a column to change its direction, try the presets drawn from hand-made sketches, randomise, explore variations and save SVG or PNG",
